p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and clothing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI (Infected, survivors and bandits)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle driving (For now only 4-wheel vehicles, in the future boats, quad, train, helicopter will be added)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swimming system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a lot more smaller and larger features await you</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348680/extras/ac717570ec9fd1b376477213cf67d264.avif?t=1775798014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348680/extras_big/ac717570ec9fd1b376477213cf67d264.avif?t=1775798014 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348680/extras/908477ef6b2a1c6b17b3ef78c01a7f74.webp?t=1775798014\" width=360 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the state of Onita, two years after the end of the world. Only a few people remain on Earth, and luckily you are one of them. Life continues in a brutal, lawless apocalypse filled with infected creatures and hostile factions from rival communities. Your only priority is to survive day by day. Loot, trade with other communities and build a safe base, find other survivals to become a community. Be the best leader and the biggest survival in this wild world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4348680/extras/3cfadbef6808a791630a31f79d26110e.webp?t=1775798014\" width=360 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>